# PrioSuite — same design on every page

Do not invent a new layout. Copy the nearest existing screen in the same domain.

## Page shell (required for form / master / report / transaction screens)

```jsx
<div className="w-full h-full flex justify-between p-1 bg-[#fefefe] rounded-lg">
  <div className="h-full flex flex-col justify-start items-center border-primary rounded-lg border-[2px] p-2 lg:p-5 w-full gap-3 overflow-hidden">
    <h3 className="text-2xl font-semibold">Page Title</h3>
    <ScrollArea className="w-full h-full">
      {/* sections */}
    </ScrollArea>
  </div>
</div>
```

- Inner sections: `border border-primary rounded-lg p-3 sm:p-5`
- Section title: `text-center text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold`
- Fields grid: `grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3 gap-x-10 gap-y-3`
- Submit: `<Button type="submit" className="w-full sm:w-1/5 self-end">` with `ClipLoader color="#d7e6f4"`
- Required labels: red `*` via `isRequired`
- Forms: `autoComplete="off"`; buttons inside forms `type="button"` unless submit

## Chrome (do not restyle)

- Font: Open Sans · radius `0.5rem` · primary `hsl(219 94% 20%)`
- Sidebar + footer: `#00264D` · content area: `bg-gray-50` · page card: `#fefefe`
- Fields: `h-10 rounded-md` via `common/formFields` only
- Tables: `components/ui/table` + `border border-primary`
- Success: `common/dialog/SuccessMessage` · toasts top-right
- Loading: `ClipLoader` / `Skeleton` with `bg-secondary`

## Exceptions

- Login / branded auth: keep existing login layout
- Dashboard home: `bg-slate-50` + cards — do not force the 2px primary shell
- Do not use MUI as default; Ant Design only on screens that already use it
